{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b3e7a1c2-4f8d-4e9b-9a3c-1d2e5f6a7b8c",
    "name": "PFM-Go API",
    "description": "Personal Financial Manager — double-entry accounting for households.\n\nBase URL: {{base_url}}\n\n## Quickstart workflow\n1. **Register** a user → `Users / Register`\n2. **Login** → token is auto-saved to `{{token}}`\n3. **Create Household** → `household_id` is auto-saved\n4. **Create Account** (x2 for double-entry) → `account_id` is auto-saved from the first\n5. **Post Transaction** → reference both account IDs in entries\n\n## Variables auto-populated by test scripts\n| Variable | Set by |\n|---|---|\n| `token` | Auth / Login |\n| `user_id` | Users / Register |\n| `household_id` | Households / Create Household |\n| `account_id` | Accounts / Create Account |\n\nSet `member_user_id` manually to the ID of a second registered user.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "https://pfm-go-api.fly.dev",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Live production API"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "PASETO v4 bearer token — auto-populated by Auth/Login"
    },
    {
      "key": "user_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Authenticated user ID — auto-populated by Users/Register"
    },
    {
      "key": "household_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Current household ID — auto-populated by Households/Create Household"
    },
    {
      "key": "account_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Primary account ID — auto-populated by Accounts/Create Account"
    },
    {
      "key": "second_account_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Second account ID for double-entry transactions — auto-populated by Accounts/Create Second Account"
    },
    {
      "key": "member_user_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "User ID of a second user to add as household member — set manually"
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "description": "Health check endpoints — no authentication required. Used by Fly.io readiness probes.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Liveness",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/health/live",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["health", "live"]
            },
            "description": "Returns 200 if the process is alive."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Readiness",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/health/ready",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["health", "ready"]
            },
            "description": "Returns 200 when the database connection is established and the server is ready to serve traffic."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Healthz (combined)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/healthz",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["healthz"]
            },
            "description": "Combined health check."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Authentication endpoints. No bearer token required.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);",
                  "    console.log('Token saved. Expires at:', json.expires_at);",
                  "} else {",
                  "    console.error('Login failed:', pm.response.text());",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"alice@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"supersecret123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Authenticate with email and password. The PASETO v4 token is automatically saved to `{{token}}` and used by all subsequent requests."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Users",
      "description": "User registration and profile management.\n\nRegistration is public. All other endpoints require authentication.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('user_id', json.id);",
                  "    console.log('User registered. ID:', json.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"display_name\": \"Alice Costa\",\n  \"email\": \"alice@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"supersecret123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/users",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "users"]
            },
            "description": "Register a new user. No authentication required. Returns 409 if email already exists.\n\nThe `user_id` is auto-saved to `{{user_id}}`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get User",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/users/{{user_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "users", "{{user_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Fetch the authenticated user's profile by ID."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"display_name\": \"Alice Costa Silva\",\n  \"version\": 1\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/users/{{user_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "users", "{{user_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Update the display name. `version` must match the current record version for optimistic concurrency control. Returns 409 on version conflict."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Change Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"old_password\": \"supersecret123\",\n  \"new_password\": \"newpassword456\",\n  \"version\": 1\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/users/{{user_id}}/password",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "users", "{{user_id}}", "password"]
            },
            "description": "Change password. Requires the current password for verification. Returns 401 if old_password is wrong."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Deactivate User",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/users/{{user_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "users", "{{user_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Soft-delete the user account. Returns 204 on success."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
