      "description": "Double-entry transaction posting and balance queries.\n\n**Double-entry rule:** Every transaction must have at least 2 entries where the sum of debits equals the sum of credits. The API will return 422 if the transaction is unbalanced.\n\n**Example — salary deposit:**\n- Debit `checking` account (money coming in) R$5,000.00\n- Credit `income` account (source of funds) R$5,000.00\n\n**Amounts** are in minor units (centavos). R$1,500.00 = 150000.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Post Transaction (salary deposit)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"description\": \"Salary — April 2026\",\n  \"transaction_date\": \"2026-04-01\",\n  \"entries\": [\n    {\n      \"account_id\": \"{{account_id}}\",\n      \"amount\": 500000,\n      \"entry_type\": \"debit\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"account_id\": \"{{second_account_id}}\",\n      \"amount\": 500000,\n      \"entry_type\": \"credit\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/households/{{household_id}}/transactions",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "households", "{{household_id}}", "transactions"]
            },
            "description": "Post a balanced transaction. Requires at least 2 entries where total debits = total credits.\n\nThis example moves R$5,000.00 from `{{second_account_id}}` to `{{account_id}}`. Replace entries with your actual account IDs and amounts.\n\nReturns 422 if entries don't balance."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List Transactions",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/households/{{household_id}}/transactions?limit=20&offset=0",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "households", "{{household_id}}", "transactions"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20", "description": "Max number of transactions to return" },
                { "key": "offset", "value": "0", "description": "Number of transactions to skip (for pagination)" },
                { "key": "account_id", "value": "", "description": "Filter by account UUID (optional)", "disabled": true }
